Description: WLAN Pi - Front Panel Management System (FPMS)
    .
    Drives the front panel of the WLAN Pi: the display and the buttons.
    The menu shown is served by wlanpi-menud; without it the panel shows
    the device's IP address and keeps retrying.
    .